*/


/* this handles a 'pile' of clothing.  Just adds/removes items from a list
And does NOT check layers/covers or anything.  This can be used for a
closet or the like.
*/

/*
  #####                                              #####
 #     # #       ####  ##### #    # # #    #  ####  #     # #####   ####  #    # #####
 #       #      #    #   #   #    # # ##   # #    # #       #    # #    # #    # #    #
