NOTE: "SUB":
    "SUB <keyword>" creates a new key word that can be used in descriptions of the piece of clothing.  The keyword can be
    any arbitrary value and there can be unlimited number of SUB entries per piece of clothing.  Common uses would be to
    define the color "sub color" or style "sub style", but it could also describe two colors ("sub color1", "sub color2"),
    the design on a graphic t-shirt "sub design", or any other aspect of a piece of clothing.  At purchase, each sub-list
    is listed, allowing the selection of ONE entry from each list.
    Displace works similarly.


SUB STYLES: (All known options)
    skinny
    tight
    stretchy
    form-fitting
    fitted
    casual
    loose
    sturdy
    relaxed fit
    boot cut
    flared
    baggy
    lowrise

